      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e And using a non-reserved one means the semantics are specific to some node - somebody else could use the same identifier for a different purpose in a different node\n\nAck, makes sense. I\u0027ll change `CertIndex::FromEnd` to `CertIndex::ByName`\n\n\nComponent name is also optional though, but I think we can mandate it for pVMs\u0027 trailing certificated (built by firmware \u0026 OS)?",
